  (https://github.com/anvaka/panzoom), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2016 - 2026
  Andrei Kashcha. It bundles amator (MIT, Copyright (c) 2016-2026 Andrei
  Kashcha), wheel (MIT, Copyright (c) 2014-2023 Andrei Kashcha), bezier-easing
  (MIT, Copyright (c) 2014 Gaëtan Renaudeau) and ngraph.events (BSD-3-Clause,
